# OpenSpoof Phase 4 — SELinux allowances for Dobby inline hooks.
#
# Inline hooking needs:
#   - anonymous RWX pages for trampolines      -> process execmem
#   - mprotect(PROT_WRITE|PROT_EXEC) on .text  -> handled via execmem on most ROMs
#
# TEMPLATE — validate on your device after running a configured app:
#   adb shell dmesg | grep 'avc:' | grep denied
# then tighten the domain below to what your ROM actually reports.
# Without a working rule, DobbyHook fails gracefully (logged, not fatal).

allow untrusted_app untrusted_app process execmem
